          "title": "带货短片已导出",
          "body": "{{start.product_name}} 的口播短片已完成,共 {{shoot_beats.count}} 拍。"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "output",
        "type": "output",
        "name": "Hand over the short and the script",
        "position": {
